{
  "id": "ISA.33",
  "number": "33",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 33",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our enemies are doomed! They have robbed and betrayed, although no one has robbed them or betrayed them. But their time to rob and betray will end, and they themselves will become victims of robbery and treachery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have mercy on us. We have put our hope in you. Protect us day by day and save us in times of trouble. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you fight for us, nations run away from the noise of battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their belongings are pounced upon and taken as loot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How great the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is! He rules over everything. He will fill Jerusalem with justice and integrity ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and give stability to the nation. He always protects his people and gives them wisdom and knowledge. Their greatest treasure is their reverence for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The brave are calling for help. The ambassadors who tried to bring about peace are crying bitterly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The highways are so dangerous that no one travels on them. Treaties are broken and agreements are violated. No one is respected any more. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The land lies idle and deserted. The forests of Lebanon have withered, the fertile valley of Sharon is like a desert, and in Bashan and on Mount Carmel the leaves are falling from the trees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to the nations, “Now I will act. I will show how powerful I am. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You make worthless plans and everything you do is useless. My spirit is like a fire that will destroy you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "My spirit",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "you",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "You are destroying yourselves.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will crumble like rocks burnt to make lime, like thorns burnt to ashes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let everyone near and far hear what I have done and acknowledge my power.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sinful people of Zion are trembling with fright. They say, “God's judgement is like a fire that burns for ever. Can any of us survive a fire like that?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can survive if you say and do what is right. Don't use your power to cheat the poor and don't accept bribes. Don't join with those who plan to commit murder or to do other evil things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will be safe; you will be as secure as if you were in a strong fortress. You will have food to eat and water to drink.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once again you will see a king ruling in splendour over a land that stretches in all directions. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your old fears of foreign tax collectors and spies will be only a memory. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will no longer see any arrogant foreigners who speak a language that you can't understand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at Zion, the city where we celebrate our religious festivals. Look at Jerusalem! What a safe place it will be to live in! It will be like a tent that is never moved, whose pegs are never pulled up and whose ropes never break. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will show us his glory. We will live beside broad rivers and streams, but hostile ships will not sail on them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 21 in Hebrew is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the rigging on those ships is useless; the sails cannot be spread! We will seize all the wealth of enemy armies, and there will be so much that even the lame can have a share. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.22+ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.22",
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " himself will be our king; he will rule over us and protect us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.22+ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.22",
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one who lives in our land will ever again complain of being ill, and all sins will be forgiven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
